Subject: [PATCH 0015] parser: harden the no-converter gate against hostile schemas and args
 (port of rasatpetabit's DSML orphan-invoke hardening series,
 patch 6/6, adapted to the c3046d1 base; original commit by
 Richard A Steenbergen <ras@petabitscale.com>)


Review round 3: catch RecursionError from deeply nested argument JSON
(reject, do not abort the request); trust "required" only when it is
entirely a list of strings, per this helper's stated all-or-nothing
contract.

Original source: https://gist.github.com/rasatpetabit/c66923a17305f04b2544f952ab8f50cb
(0006-parser-harden-the-no-converter-gate-against-hostile-.patch in that series; hardens the orphan-invoke recovery
path added by 0009/vllm-project/vllm#49117.)

